{"id":"a101152a4f31cd83","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-dcpo-function-space.md","title":"连续函数空间","display":"df-dcpo-function-space — 连续函数空间","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-dcpo-function-space","aliases":["16-df-dcpo-function-space"],"display":"df-dcpo-function-space — 连续函数空间","depends_on":["[[16-df-cpo]]"],"source":"Preliminaries p. xvii (PDF 19); §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-dcpo-function-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-dcpo-function-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dcpo-function-space — 连续函数空间"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Preliminaries p. xvii (PDF 19); §10.6 p. 638 (PDF 658)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,E,Z\">\\(D,E,Z\\)</span> 为小 dcpo，偏序、非空有向集、上确界及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\">\\(\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d561a55729f9cdb8\" href=\"?note=d561a55729f9cdb8\" title=\"16-df-cpo\">16-df-cpo</a>。同一字母兼指携带已指定偏序的载体；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^D\">\\(E^D\\)</span> 在集合层表示全函数集。</li>\n<li>序关系定义式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in|[D,E]|\">\\(f,g\\in|[D,E]|\\)</span>；该关系的论域是下文连续函数载体的平方。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:Z\\times D\\to E\">\\(h:Z\\times D\\to E\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k:Z\\to[D,E]\">\\(k:Z\\to[D,E]\\)</span> 为连续函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in Z,x\\in D\">\\(z\\in Z,x\\in D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{curry}(h):Z\\to[D,E]\">\\(\\operatorname{curry}(h):Z\\to[D,E]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{uncurry}(k):Z\\times D\\to E\">\\(\\operatorname{uncurry}(k):Z\\times D\\to E\\)</span> 为下文构造的函数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\times E\">\\(D\\times E\\)</span> 取逐分量序；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\pi_2\">\\(\\pi_1,\\pi_2\\)</span> 为集合投影。下文定义函数空间的载体和偏序，以及求值与柯里化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n|[D,E]|&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\in E^D\\mid\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\},\\\\\nf\\leq_{[D,E]}g&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x\\in D)\\ f(x)\\leq_Eg(x),\\\\\n[D,E]&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle |[D,E]|,\\leq_{[D,E]}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E}&amp;:[D,E]\\times D\\to E,\n&amp;\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E}(f,x)&amp;\\coloneqq f(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{curry}(h)(z)(x)&amp;\\coloneqq h(z,x),\n&amp;\\operatorname{uncurry}(k)(z,x)&amp;\\coloneqq k(z)(x).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n|[D,E]|&amp;\\coloneqq\\{f\\in E^D\\mid\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\},\\\\\nf\\leq_{[D,E]}g&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x\\in D)\\ f(x)\\leq_Eg(x),\\\\\n[D,E]&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle |[D,E]|,\\leq_{[D,E]}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E}&amp;:[D,E]\\times D\\to E,\n&amp;\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E}(f,x)&amp;\\coloneqq f(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{curry}(h)(z)(x)&amp;\\coloneqq h(z,x),\n&amp;\\operatorname{uncurry}(k)(z,x)&amp;\\coloneqq k(z)(x).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Preliminaries, p. xvii (PDF 19)；§10.6 开头，p. 638 (PDF 658)。原书明确给出逐点序的连续函数空间；本页展开其集合记录。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[D,E]\">\\([D,E]\\)</span> 不表示全部集合函数，也不要求连续函数保持底。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-cpo","status":"resolved","id":"d561a55729f9cdb8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,E,Z$ 为小 dcpo，偏序、非空有向集、上确界及 $\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)$ 采用 [[16-df-cpo]]。同一字母兼指携带已指定偏序的载体；$E^D$ 在集合层表示全函数集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,E,Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)","display":false},{"tex":"E^D","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in|[D,E]|","display":false},{"tex":"h:Z\\times D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"k:Z\\to[D,E]","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in Z,x\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{curry}(h):Z\\to[D,E]","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{uncurry}(k):Z\\times D\\to E","display":false},{"tex":"D\\times E","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\pi_2","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n|[D,E]|&\\coloneqq\\{f\\in E^D\\mid\\mathrm{ScottCont}(f,D,E)\\},\\\\\nf\\leq_{[D,E]}g&\\Longleftrightarrow(\\forall x\\in D)\\ f(x)\\leq_Eg(x),\\\\\n[D,E]&\\coloneqq\\langle |[D,E]|,\\leq_{[D,E]}\\rangle,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E}&:[D,E]\\times D\\to E,\n&\\operatorname{ev}_{D,E}(f,x)&\\coloneqq f(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{curry}(h)(z)(x)&\\coloneqq h(z,x),\n&\\operatorname{uncurry}(k)(z,x)&\\coloneqq k(z)(x).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"[D,E]","display":false}],"bytes":1709,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-48","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-cpo]]、[[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]、[[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]、[[16-df-embedding-projection]]、[[16-thm-ep-properties]]、[[16-thm-ep-bilimit]]、[[16-thm-inverse-limit]]、[[16-df-lambda-category]]、[[16-thm-domain-model]]。极限构造的完整证明是明示的本地补写；λ-category 按 §2.5 的指定反身对象接口定义。"},{"id":"6e7c6dac50ba7c59","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D,E,Z$ 为小 dcpo，$[D,E]$、$\\operatorname{ev}$、$\\operatorname{curry}$、$\\operatorname{uncurry}$ 见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]。"},{"id":"343cd2798c360ffe","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D$ 为小 dcpo，$\\alpha:D\\to[D,D]$、$\\beta:[D,D]\\to D$ 连续且互逆；函数空间见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]]，其指数定理见 [[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]。"},{"id":"fc728ef2e25025aa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cb45d716150df5b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_0$ 为小的带底 dcpo，$\\bot_0$ 为其最小元；连续函数空间见 [[16-df-dcpo-function-space]] 及 [[16-thm-dcpo-exponential]]。"}],"outgoing":["d561a55729f9cdb8"]}